": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497720092535018921", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13150768", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043038417", "personaname": "KENSHIN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yzfatih/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 418, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 405, "last_played": 1434913731, "avatar": "6207eacccd25d1c620bcbd48d416b013c0cf1b89"}, "language": "english", "review": "I recommend this game for everyone just because you play as a badass Space Marine. So basically you are a demigod that can smash everything that comes in your way. But the thing is game is too repetitive and after 4 hours game time, i still gotta kill little powerless orcs is made me bored. I can only stand half an hour, then i leave and play another time. I dont remember when i bought this game, but i hope i will finish it one day. Dont know when :)\n\nEdit: Yeah, i finally finished the game. Ending was not that great gameplay-wise, story wise its kinda OK. 7.7 hours on record but i spend probably 1.5 hours of that time on alt tab. So expect about 6 hours of gameplay. I tried Multiplayer once, didnt really liked it. So thats all W40k Space Marine for me. Time to erase and never come back.\n\nFor the EMPEROR!", "timestamp_created": 1417300616, "timestamp_updated": 1434919001, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13131740", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024710846", "personaname": "